    "body": "@annevk I meant to use the following xrefs:\n- ServiceWorkerGlobalScope: https://slightlyoff.github.io/ServiceWorker/spec/service_worker/index.html#service-worker-global-scope-interface\n- ServiceWorkerGlobalScope's associated service worker: https://slightlyoff.github.io/ServiceWorker/spec/service_worker/index.html#dfn-service-worker-global-scope-service-worker\n- service worker's script resource: https://slightlyoff.github.io/ServiceWorker/spec/service_worker/index.html#dfn-script-resource\n- script resource's has ever been evaluated flag: https://slightlyoff.github.io/ServiceWorker/spec/service_worker/index.html#dfn-has-ever-been-evaluated-flag\n",
